

<& "/page/page_title.mas", title => "SGN 說明(SGN Help)" &>

<p>
茄科基因體網絡 (Sol Genomics Network, SGN) 是一個專門提供茄科植物基因體資訊的資料庫與網站，包含番茄、馬鈴薯、辣椒、矮牽牛和茄子等物種。(The Sol Genomics Network (SGN) is a database and website dedicated to the genomic information of the nightshade family, which includes species such as tomato, potato, pepper, petunia and eggplant.)
</p>
<h4>引用 SGN(Citing SGN)</h4>

如果 SGN 對您的研究有所幫助，請在您的發表文獻中使用以下參考資料引用 SGN：(If SGN is useful in your research, please cite SGN in your publications using the following reference:)
<br /><br />
<div class="boxbgcolor2">
Fernandez-Pozo N, Menda N, Edwards JD, Saha S, Tecle IY, Strickler SR, Bombarely A, Fisher-York T, Pujar A, Foerster H, Yan A, Mueller LA. <b>The Sol Genomics Network (SGN)—from genotype to phenotype to breeding.</b> (2015) Nucleic Acids Res. Volume 43 (Database issue):D1036-41. <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25428362?dopt=Abstract">PubMed</a>.
<br /><br />
</div>

<br>查看更多 <a href="/help/publications">SGN 出版文獻(SGN publications)</a>(See more <a href="/help/publications">SGN publications</a>)
</p>

